    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "JB Kelly presents 24 Sutton Grove, a four-bedroom semi-detached family home located in one of Sutton’s most established and convenient residential neighbourhoods. The property occupies a mature setting close to a wide range of amenities and offers excellent potential for future enhancement and extension, subject to planning permission.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well proportioned and comprises an entrance hall with guest WC, a spacious living room to the front with double doors through to a separate sitting room to the rear and a kitchen dining room. Upstairs, there are four bedrooms together with a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nA notable feature of the property is the attached single garage to the side, which offers clear potential for conversion and possible extension above, subject to the necessary planning permission. Externally, there is off-street parking to the front via a private driveway, while the rear garden provides a generous outdoor space with mature hedging, ideally suited to family use.\r\n\r\nThe location is particularly appealing for families, with a range of primary and secondary schools within easy reach. Bayside Shopping Centre is within walking distance and provides a variety of everyday services including Aldi, cafés, pharmacy, medical centre, gym, crèche and convenience shopping. The seafront promenade, cycle track, local parks and sports facilities are also nearby, while Bayside DART Station and regular bus services provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nThis property represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a family home in a mature coastal suburb, combining generous accommodation, future potential and exceptional convenience in a highly regarded residential location.\r\n\r\nTo arrange an appointment to view, contact JB Kelly on 01-8393400."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n2.70 x 4.60m\r\nUnderstair storage\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n3.85 x 4.30m\r\nFireplace with gas fire insert, double doors through to\r\n\r\nSitting Room\r\n3.85 x 3.30\r\nLaminate floors, sliding patio door to rear garden\r\n\r\nKitchen Dining Room\r\n4.30 x 3.30m\r\nRange of fitted presses and wall-mounted units, fridge freezer, oven, hob.\r\nGlazed side door to rear.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n1.15 x 1.40m\r\nWC & WHB\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.40 x 3.90m\r\nDouble bedroom to the front, built-in closet\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.90 x 3.40m\r\nDouble bedroom to the rear, built-in closet\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.20 x 2.10m\r\nSingle bedroom to the rear\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n3.20 x 2.20m\r\nSingle bedroom to the front"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
